=== key_sw_gpio_tb.sv (direct unit test) ===
10/10 PASS, 0 errors. One real testbench bug found+fixed: do_read sampled
mem_rdata one cycle too late relative to the DUT's clear-on-read side
effect (both happen combinationally/synchronously at the SAME edge in a
real single-cycle bus master like cpu_core.sv; the testbench's original
"wait a full cycle then sample" pattern raced past the value). Fixed by
sampling mem_rdata via #1 immediately after asserting mem_valid, matching
cpu_core's own sampling convention.

